            <ArticleTitle>Combined use of retrograde myocardial and distal coronary protection for last vessel intervention in an aortocoronary vein graft.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>342-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Feasibility, safety, and clinical efficacy of the combined application of the PercuSurge system and the Myoprotect SSR device was demonstrated in a patient with high-risk anatomy undergoing saphenous vein graft intervention. This combined approach of coronary and myocardial protection may be considered in high-risk aortocoronary vein graft interventions.</AbstractText>
